WEBVTT

00:01:33.120 --> 00:01:37.650
Zeo, who we met during
Ozma's sudden attack,

00:01:37.650 --> 00:01:41.130
said he wanted Takao
to teach him Beyblading.

00:01:45.830 --> 00:01:51.060
Rei accepted a challenge from
Foxy, a mysterious Blader.

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:55.060
A Sacred Beast appeared
from Foxy's Beyblade!

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:28.100
Driger!

00:02:31.840 --> 00:02:33.210
Found you!

00:02:33.210 --> 00:02:35.800
Finish him off, Driger!

00:03:04.070 --> 00:03:08.100
This is the data on the Sacred Beast that came
from Foxy's Bey in the battle the other day.

00:03:08.880 --> 00:03:13.520
And when we compare it to the data
from the tablet stolen from Judy's lab...

00:03:17.410 --> 00:03:18.260
See?

00:03:18.680 --> 00:03:22.130
"See" what? I don't
understand a thing, Kyoujyu!

00:03:22.130 --> 00:03:25.010
He's right! Explain it in a
way we can understand.

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:27.350
All of the numbers lined up.

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:35.290
Basically, there's no doubt that fox
Sacred Beast was stolen from Judy's lab.

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:36.160
--What?!

00:03:36.160 --> 00:03:37.600
Is that true, mom?

00:03:37.600 --> 00:03:39.740
Unfortunately, yes.

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:45.700
Wait! If I recall, the Sacred Beast
we saw at the lab wasn't complete.

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:48.000
It was just a mass
of energy, right?

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:52.160
They must have the technology to convert that mass of energy

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:54.640
into a Sacred Beast and
put it in a Bit Chip.

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:58.310
And now we have
proof of that.

00:03:58.310 --> 00:04:01.890
If they have that kind
of advanced technology...

00:04:01.890 --> 00:04:07.470
Then it means they're at least
as fearsome as Gideon's group!

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:08.560
--What?!

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:13.570
Yeah... This time they're real
Sacred Beasts, not digital ones.

00:04:13.570 --> 00:04:19.380
And Foxy made it clear that stealing
our four Sacred Beasts was his mission.

00:04:19.380 --> 00:04:23.280
But it's okay because we
won't lose them that easily.

00:04:23.790 --> 00:04:26.600
After all,
you managed to beat Foxy.

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:29.150
There's no guarantee
you'll win the next one.

00:04:29.150 --> 00:04:30.280
Huh?

00:04:30.280 --> 00:04:36.360
There's unfathomable power
hiding inside the stone tablet.

00:04:36.360 --> 00:04:40.790
Your rivals have the potential to summon
even more powerful Sacred Beasts.

00:04:40.790 --> 00:04:46.970
It's even possible they could send Sacred Beasts after
you that are even more powerful than your four.

00:04:50.130 --> 00:04:51.600
No...

00:04:53.130 --> 00:04:59.010
Darn it... First Ozma's team, and
now these guys are after us...

00:04:59.310 --> 00:05:02.210
What the heck do they want
with our Sacred Beasts?!

00:05:02.210 --> 00:05:02.760
Who knows...

00:05:02.760 --> 00:05:05.780
Kyoujyu! This is
a huge problem!

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:08.680
Can't you analyze something
with this thing?!

00:05:08.680 --> 00:05:10.960
Using this camera
thingy here, maybe!

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:12.880
What do you
think you're doing?

00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:15.380
Don't touch it!
You're gonna break it!

00:05:15.380 --> 00:05:17.170
Cut it out, Takao!

00:05:22.700 --> 00:05:26.180
Kinomiya, you're precious
little apprentice is here.

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:27.010
Huh?

00:05:28.100 --> 00:05:29.280
Zeo!

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:35.920
You wanna battle me?

00:05:35.920 --> 00:05:42.240
I don't know what level I'm at, and I want
someone stronger than me to practice against.

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:43.940
Takao, please!

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:46.080
Oh, I see...

00:05:47.890 --> 00:05:48.780
No.

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:50.690
Wait! Why not?

00:05:50.690 --> 00:05:56.440
What's wrong with you?
Challenging me to a battle all of a sudden?

00:05:56.440 --> 00:05:58.760
I know I'm getting
ahead of myself.

00:05:58.760 --> 00:06:02.060
But please, I'm begging you!

00:06:02.060 --> 00:06:05.010
I'm telling you dude,
now's not the best time.

00:06:05.010 --> 00:06:09.490
I don't have time to
just battle for fun. See ya.

00:06:09.490 --> 00:06:11.940
Jeez, calling a guy out
for something like that.

00:06:11.940 --> 00:06:14.480
I'm a busy man these days.

00:06:15.570 --> 00:06:19.460
The truth is, there's an advancement
test at the gym I go to.

00:06:19.460 --> 00:06:24.800
I can't move up to the next class unless I
beat a Blader from the high leveled classes!

00:06:25.300 --> 00:06:28.620
Oh. Sucks to be you.
Break a leg.

00:06:28.810 --> 00:06:30.480
What's your problem?!

00:06:30.480 --> 00:06:33.820
I want to be strong!
Just like you, Takao!

00:06:33.820 --> 00:06:38.840
So I have to pass this
test, no matter what!

00:06:38.840 --> 00:06:39.970
Zeo...

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:43.240
So please battle with me!

00:06:43.240 --> 00:06:45.120
Please, Takao!

00:06:47.740 --> 00:06:51.130
Guess I have to...
But just once.

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:55.540
Takao's going
to battle Zeo?

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:57.870
What's up with
that Zeo kid?

00:06:57.870 --> 00:07:00.610
His abilities are
still unknown to us.

00:07:00.610 --> 00:07:03.050
I think this will be
worth recording.

00:07:06.580 --> 00:07:08.400
Let's get started, Zeo.

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:11.860
--Three! Two! One!

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:14.100
--Go, Shoot!

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:15.780
Go, Zeronix!

00:07:19.440 --> 00:07:20.440
What?

00:07:20.440 --> 00:07:25.540
Hey, come on now. Do you seriously think you
can take Dragoon down with an attack like that?

00:07:25.730 --> 00:07:27.100
Darn it!

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:29.140
Give it some oomph!

00:07:29.140 --> 00:07:30.470
Zeronix!

00:07:33.580 --> 00:07:34.690
Yeah!

00:07:35.200 --> 00:07:37.540
He's not half bad.

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:39.600
The problem is what's next.

00:07:39.770 --> 00:07:42.800
Alright. Now it's my turn.

00:07:49.680 --> 00:07:51.340
And that's the game.

00:07:51.340 --> 00:07:53.460
He didn't stand a chance...

00:07:53.460 --> 00:07:55.750
No, look.
He's still spinning.

00:07:55.750 --> 00:07:56.530
--Huh?

00:07:56.530 --> 00:07:57.460
What?

00:07:58.690 --> 00:08:00.430
Go, Zeronix!

00:08:07.430 --> 00:08:08.710
Darn!!

00:08:08.900 --> 00:08:12.410
It doesn't look like
his attacks are working...

00:08:12.610 --> 00:08:15.440
Zeo's attack's
aren't landing well.

00:08:15.440 --> 00:08:17.170
He needs more accuracy.

00:08:17.170 --> 00:08:20.240
You can't just charge in!

00:08:20.530 --> 00:08:23.500
Let me show you
what a real attack is.

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:25.570
Go, Dragoon!

00:08:33.010 --> 00:08:34.900
He's hanging on.

00:08:34.900 --> 00:08:36.970
He's pretty good.

00:08:37.860 --> 00:08:39.460
I refuse to lose!

00:08:39.770 --> 00:08:41.840
Why you little...

00:08:42.090 --> 00:08:44.220
I'm gonna finish you off!

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:55.840
Dragoon, there!

00:08:59.980 --> 00:09:01.730
And that's that.

00:09:02.030 --> 00:09:03.860
Get it?

00:09:03.860 --> 00:09:07.280
You can't just
battle by charging in.

00:09:13.840 --> 00:09:15.190
Hey!

00:09:15.330 --> 00:09:17.460
Takao, that was too harsh.

00:09:17.460 --> 00:09:21.330
Yeah! Zeo's still in training!
I feel bad for him!

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:23.620
It's his fault!

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:29.380
He was real pushy about battling
me even after I said I didn't have time.

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:34.000
Well, I think it's okay if you consider
it a lesson on the cruelty of battle.

00:09:34.290 --> 00:09:36.180
But even so...

00:09:36.180 --> 00:09:40.390
He looked really bummed.
Like it was really personal.

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:42.710
No way!

00:09:53.840 --> 00:09:54.900
Doctor.

00:09:56.450 --> 00:10:00.240
His Sacred Beast
training is ready to go.

00:10:00.520 --> 00:10:03.080
We just need your
orders, Doctor.

00:10:03.270 --> 00:10:04.450
Not yet.

00:10:05.300 --> 00:10:09.160
Why did we lose to Rei
Kon in that battle earlier?

00:10:09.160 --> 00:10:12.670
Finding a solid explanation
for that comes first.

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:15.610
The explanation is clear.

00:10:15.610 --> 00:10:20.370
Foxy and the Sacred Beast weren't
good enough to defeat Rei Kon.

00:10:20.600 --> 00:10:23.930
If we had a stronger
Blader and Sacred Beast...

00:10:23.930 --> 00:10:27.490
You still don't get it,
do you Doctor?

00:10:27.830 --> 00:10:33.280
Our goal is not to compete
against their Sacred Beasts with ours.

00:10:33.280 --> 00:10:36.810
It's to obtain them
for ourselves.

00:10:37.330 --> 00:10:38.580
Obviously.

00:10:38.580 --> 00:10:42.330
We can't afford to
repeat the same mistakes

00:10:42.330 --> 00:10:45.790
by haphazardly throwing
out Sacred Beasts.

00:10:46.260 --> 00:10:50.490
But I think it's more
effective to commit

00:10:50.490 --> 00:10:56.400
to an all-out attack in a battle
between Sacred Beasts.

00:10:56.400 --> 00:10:59.930
I'll listen to your plan later.

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:03.470
For now, refine the
plan we currently have.

00:11:03.780 --> 00:11:05.290
Got it?

00:11:07.140 --> 00:11:11.090
I'll go and create a new
list of chosen Bladers.

00:11:11.090 --> 00:11:17.120
As long as the Doctor is free, put a stop to
all plans related to using new Sacred Beasts.

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:19.830
The bigger problem is
getting beaten to the punch

00:11:19.830 --> 00:11:23.700
by that group of four while
we're twiddling our thumbs.

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:27.510
Then why not send their
data to the Doctor, too?

00:11:28.570 --> 00:11:31.540
He trusts the numbers
more than he trusts me.

00:11:32.910 --> 00:11:40.060
Does he even realize how much I risked
my life to steal that tablet in New York?

00:11:40.640 --> 00:11:43.650
I'm going to continue to keep
an eye on Kinomiya's team.

00:11:43.650 --> 00:11:44.590
Wait.

00:11:46.350 --> 00:11:50.460
Bring another list of Bladers
fit to use our new Sacred Beasts.

00:11:50.460 --> 00:11:53.000
But I thought I was
to create a new one?

00:11:53.000 --> 00:11:54.740
Change of plans.

00:12:05.530 --> 00:12:15.460
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:12:15.650 --> 00:12:20.760
What? You want me to create a training
regimen to fight against Sacred Beasts?

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:26.240
Yeah. I'll keep up with whatever weird
or strict regimens you throw at me.

00:12:26.240 --> 00:12:29.370
So please, you gotta
think of something!

00:12:29.370 --> 00:12:31.730
But it's so sudden...

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:37.080
What's gotten into you, Takao?
You slack off on training more than anyone.

00:12:37.080 --> 00:12:41.110
It's rare to see
you ask for it.

00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:48.790
Look! I just wanna do what I can to prepare for
these guys coming after the four Sacred Beasts!

00:12:48.790 --> 00:12:51.250
I know how you feel, but...

00:12:51.250 --> 00:12:56.770
How do you plan on countering Bladers and
Sacred Beasts we've never fought before?

00:12:56.770 --> 00:12:59.270
Uhh, well...

00:12:59.270 --> 00:13:01.440
I can't just sit here!

00:13:01.440 --> 00:13:04.090
Now that's that
typical Takao mindset.

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:05.630
Shut up!

00:13:05.630 --> 00:13:10.690
Listen! Our new enemies have
ridiculous technology behind them!

00:13:10.690 --> 00:13:13.230
You guys know that, right?!

00:13:13.230 --> 00:13:18.310
I don't think training recklessly
is the way to go about it.

00:13:18.680 --> 00:13:19.910
What do you think, mom?

00:13:19.910 --> 00:13:21.910
Let's see...

00:13:22.210 --> 00:13:27.520
As long as we don't know how strong the
next Sacred Beast from the tablet will be,

00:13:27.520 --> 00:13:31.160
I don't think any sort of
training will give peace of mind.

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:36.550
So you're saying we should just
wait for them to come to us?!

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:38.980
Okay.

00:13:39.890 --> 00:13:43.140
I'll try to think of
a training regimen.

00:13:43.140 --> 00:13:45.060
Really, Kyoujyu?!

00:13:45.060 --> 00:13:49.710
In exchange, there's no complaining, and you'll do as I say, okay?

00:13:49.710 --> 00:13:50.670
Okay?

00:13:50.670 --> 00:13:54.210
Yeah, I will! Right? Right?

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:58.980
Three! Two! One!

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:01.200
Go, Shoot!

00:14:05.590 --> 00:14:10.680
This is training to attack your
opponent in an unbalanced stadium.

00:14:10.680 --> 00:14:14.810
The goal is to try and control your
balance and manage your power.

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:16.740
It's gonna fall!

00:14:18.990 --> 00:14:20.270
Driger!

00:14:24.810 --> 00:14:26.640
He held on!

00:14:26.640 --> 00:14:28.560
Go, Draciel!

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:34.980
Dang that looks like fun!

00:14:34.980 --> 00:14:36.410
Let me in on this!

00:14:36.410 --> 00:14:38.430
You have to
wait your turn!

00:14:38.430 --> 00:14:40.780
Go, Dragoon!

00:14:47.620 --> 00:14:48.940
Wait, no!

00:14:48.940 --> 00:14:51.700
Don't fall! Don't fall!

00:14:54.180 --> 00:14:56.950
You're not supposed to fall...

00:14:57.570 --> 00:14:59.120
What's this for?

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:01.140
It's a machine to
strengthen your shots.

00:15:01.140 --> 00:15:07.210
Specifically, it's a heavy weight
device meant to strengthen your shots.

00:15:07.600 --> 00:15:10.540
Can you really shoot
with these things on?

00:15:10.990 --> 00:15:15.010
This isn't good enough, Kyoujyu.
They're too light, so make it heavier!

00:15:15.010 --> 00:15:17.330
Don't overdo it...

00:15:17.330 --> 00:15:19.250
Just do it!

00:15:19.250 --> 00:15:21.940
What's the rush, Kinomiya?

00:15:21.940 --> 00:15:23.130
What do you mean?

00:15:23.130 --> 00:15:26.720
Calm down. Panicking in battle
will do you do no good.

00:15:26.720 --> 00:15:30.070
Are you really sure
about this, Takao?

00:15:30.850 --> 00:15:33.290
Yeah, this is fine!

00:15:33.290 --> 00:15:37.390
There's no point in training
unless it's a little rough...

00:15:37.390 --> 00:15:38.450
Here we go!

00:15:45.890 --> 00:15:48.760
We warned you...

00:15:49.040 --> 00:15:51.550
Goddammit!!

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:54.900
Where the hell did
they get a Sacred Beast?

00:15:54.900 --> 00:15:57.980
Can you not break our stuff?

00:15:57.980 --> 00:15:58.630
What?!

00:15:58.630 --> 00:16:00.610
You get mad
way too fast.

00:16:02.260 --> 00:16:06.440
That was definitely a Sacred
Beast from the tablet...

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:09.970
The problem is a matter of
who unsealed it, and how.

00:16:09.970 --> 00:16:11.410
What's the plan, Ozma?

00:16:11.410 --> 00:16:14.900
Are we gonna go find where
these Sacred Beasts are comin' from?

00:16:14.900 --> 00:16:17.730
The opposite.
We're going to crush them.

00:16:17.730 --> 00:16:19.400
Crush 'em?

00:16:19.620 --> 00:16:22.660
How? We don't even
know where they are!

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:25.160
Dunga, you're as slow as ever.

00:16:25.440 --> 00:16:27.640
He doesn't mean
those Sacred Beasts.

00:16:27.640 --> 00:16:28.660
What?

00:16:28.660 --> 00:16:32.200
Go do some
handstands or something.

00:16:32.200 --> 00:16:35.690
The blood rushing to your head
might help you keep up.

00:16:35.690 --> 00:16:39.110
Ozma... You mean
Kinomiya's team?

00:16:43.990 --> 00:16:47.690
Just as a warning, but this
is going to be an all out war.

00:16:49.090 --> 00:16:50.310
Seiryu...

00:16:50.800 --> 00:16:53.710
There's all sorts of
guys coming after you.

00:16:54.350 --> 00:16:59.340
But don't worry. I'm going to
protect you, no matter what.

00:16:59.340 --> 00:17:03.410
Damn! Go, Zeronix!

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:05.410
Zeo!

00:17:08.970 --> 00:17:11.560
Crap! One more time!

00:17:15.060 --> 00:17:16.140
Takao.

00:17:16.950 --> 00:17:19.440
Zeo, what are you...

00:17:20.100 --> 00:17:21.700
You saw me?

00:17:21.700 --> 00:17:27.580
I've been secretly practicing, and was thinking
about challenging you again once I improved.

00:17:27.580 --> 00:17:30.470
Challenge me again?
You're still...

00:17:30.470 --> 00:17:33.480
Obviously!
I want to win!

00:17:33.480 --> 00:17:38.720
I want to improve! I'll do
whatever it takes to win, or to improve!

00:17:38.720 --> 00:17:39.930
That's it!

00:17:45.200 --> 00:17:47.010
Yes! That's it!

00:17:49.530 --> 00:17:54.020
Whatever it takes
to win, or to improve...

00:17:55.690 --> 00:17:58.600
Yes! I finally made
it to the end!

00:17:58.600 --> 00:17:59.440
Awesome!

00:17:59.440 --> 00:18:01.140
Don't count your chickens.

00:18:01.140 --> 00:18:01.750
Huh?

00:18:01.750 --> 00:18:06.370
We won't know how well your
attacks land without a real battle, right?

00:18:06.520 --> 00:18:07.850
Are you sure?

00:18:08.260 --> 00:18:11.000
No questions!
Now get ready!

00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:18.090
Three! Two! One!

00:18:18.090 --> 00:18:20.470
Go, Shoot!

00:18:20.820 --> 00:18:23.120
Go, Zeronix!

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:26.690
You're still green!

00:18:27.510 --> 00:18:29.300
Zeronix!

00:18:37.570 --> 00:18:39.680
Well? Is that all?

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:42.210
Here I come! Dragoon!

00:18:47.130 --> 00:18:48.680
Wow...

00:18:49.080 --> 00:18:51.650
Once more! Shoot again!

00:18:53.560 --> 00:18:56.730
Get in there! Zeronix!!

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:07.450
Darn it!

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:09.000
This time for sure!

00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:20.880
Go! This time I'll win!

00:19:21.710 --> 00:19:26.260
Zeo's eyes are full
of drive and passion...

00:19:26.500 --> 00:19:30.420
Yeah... This is what I forgot.

00:19:31.230 --> 00:19:34.910
Worrying about losing the four
Sacred Beasts isn't the priority.

00:19:35.790 --> 00:19:40.020
It's simple. If we stay
strong and enjoy the battle,

00:19:42.220 --> 00:19:45.040
we've got nothing to fear.

00:19:45.890 --> 00:19:48.610
Go, Zeronix!

00:19:53.110 --> 00:19:55.400
Fight him back, Dragoon!

00:20:00.960 --> 00:20:02.720
Good job, Zeo!

00:20:03.330 --> 00:20:05.010
You've improved.

00:20:05.010 --> 00:20:07.490
You'll be fine!
You can win.

00:20:08.110 --> 00:20:08.930
Takao...

00:20:08.930 --> 00:20:11.420
Good luck on
your test-thing.

00:20:11.420 --> 00:20:13.730
We'll come cheer you on.

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:15.630
Okay!

00:20:21.830 --> 00:20:24.020
That's it, Zeo!

00:20:24.210 --> 00:20:26.500
Analyze his moves!

00:20:26.500 --> 00:20:29.300
Go, Zeronix!

00:20:30.560 --> 00:20:32.250
Bring it on!

00:20:32.880 --> 00:20:34.580
Go, Zeo!

00:20:40.980 --> 00:20:42.050
What?

00:20:42.690 --> 00:20:44.720
Zeo wins! You pass!

00:20:45.130 --> 00:20:46.640
I did it!

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:48.130
That was great, Zeo!

00:20:48.130 --> 00:20:49.700
Congrats, Zeo!

00:20:49.700 --> 00:20:53.400
I did it! Now I can advance
to the high level class!

00:20:53.400 --> 00:20:54.900
Good for you!

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:57.770
It's all thanks to your training,
Takao! Thank you!

00:20:58.360 --> 00:20:59.380
Training?

00:20:59.380 --> 00:21:01.550
When did you...?

00:21:01.550 --> 00:21:03.840
I should be
thanking you, Zeo.

00:21:04.740 --> 00:21:06.890
That desire to win...

00:21:06.890 --> 00:21:13.700
You're the one who reminded me
what that's supposed to feel like, Zeo.

00:21:13.900 --> 00:21:15.220
Takao...

00:21:30.980 --> 00:21:34.290
The four Sacred Beasts
will be ours!

00:23:00.530 --> 00:23:04.550
The battle for the four Sacred Beasts is getting more and more intense.

00:23:04.650 --> 00:23:07.940
Ozma's team comes to
take our Sacred Beasts.

00:23:07.940 --> 00:23:10.640
And their secret
will be revealed!

00:23:10.640 --> 00:23:13.770
Chairman! Things are
getting complicated!

00:23:13.770 --> 00:23:16.560
Next episode will be Rei
and Dunga's intense battle!

00:23:16.560 --> 00:23:19.720
A fierce battle to the end!
Thanks for watching!

00:23:19.720 --> 00:23:22.490
You really don't want to
miss the next episode!
